 ### SCENARIO-PHASE4-033
 **Description:** Running Exp 4025 either writes `complete: arcmemo_v5_no_transfer_<reason>` when required upstream artifacts are missing, unconfirmed, or show no seeded cost reduction, or writes `success: arcmemo_v5_transfer_<actions_cold>to<actions_seeded>_actions` only when the summed .372 seeded arm uses fewer actions or fewer induction calls than the cold arm on the same Exp 4021 and Exp 4024 content. A valid artifact MUST report `solve_transfer_win` as a bare boolean, `actions_cold` and `actions_seeded` as bare integers, cite the upstream inference substrate, and keep the verdict terminal-prefixed without claiming that memory helped merely because concepts were stored.
+
+### REQ-PHASE4-034: GAP-4 Verifier Vs LLM-Judge Efficiency Corrigendum
+**Description:** The system SHALL run Exp 4026 as a corrected efficiency comparison between the model-free GAP-4 verifier and an LLM judge over the same cached ARC-1 and ARC-2 candidate sets used by Exp 4013. It MUST reuse the candidate selections already materialized by Exp 4013 when available, avoid new Codex induction, compute accuracy parity from the verifier and judge gold-choice rates, and correct the Exp 4013 TAUTOLOGY failure by reporting measured wall-clock seconds as an independent cost axis rather than deriving cost from token counts. The terminal artifact `results/experiment_4026_verifier_vs_judge_efficiency.json` MUST include bare top-level fields `honest_verdict`, `accuracy_parity`, `wallclock_seconds_ratio_judge_over_verifier`, `token_ratio_judge_over_verifier`, and `inference_substrate`, and SHOULD preserve the Exp 4013 source citation, per-arm seconds, token totals, and candidate-set summary that support those scalars.
+
+### SCENARIO-PHASE4-034
+**Description:** Running Exp 4026 either writes `blocked_exp4013_candidate_summary_missing` when the cached Exp 4013 candidate-set selections are unavailable, or writes a terminal-prefixed corrected artifact that confirms or rejects parity from the same candidate-set rows. A valid corrected artifact MUST set `wallclock_seconds_ratio_judge_over_verifier` from independently measured judge and verifier wall-clock seconds, set `token_ratio_judge_over_verifier` from token totals, keep both ratios finite positive floats, and ensure the two ratio fields are not bit-identical so reviewers can verify that the corrected cost axis is not algebraically collapsed into the token axis.
